                       DayDream BBS V1.01, NodeMessage
                       -------------------------------

OFFSET  TYPE     LENGTH  DESCRIPTION                                     FLAGS
==============================================================================
 0000   WORD       02    COMMAND ID                                        (-)
 0002   LONG WORD  04    COMMAND DATA FIELD #1                             (-)
 0006   LONG WORD  04    COMMAND DATA FIELD #2                             (-)
 0010   LONG WORD  04    COMMAND DATA FIELD #3                             (-)
 0014   STRING     200   BLOCK FOR PASSING STRINGS                         (-)
==============================================================================
                   214

===( ID: 00001 - Type String )================================================

Print text contained in string block.

===( ID: 00002 - Open Screen )================================================

Open screen.

===( ID: 00003 - Close Screen )===============================================

Close screen.

===( ID: 00004 - Shutdown )===================================================

Shutdown node.

===( ID: 00005 - Kick user )==================================================

Kick user online.

===( ID: 00006 - Enter Chat )=================================================

Enables chat mode.

===( ID: 00007 - Type string & file )=========================================

Type string and display text file.

First prints string block and then displays [OLMPATH]OLM_[node]_[data1],
eg. T:Olms/OLM_2_5454

